// DX7-style self-feedback operator (DynGen/EEL2)
// Feedback uses the AVERAGE of the last two output samples (Yamaha's
// anti-hunting low-pass), unlike FM7 which feeds back a single sample.
// params: _freq (Hz), _fb (feedback index, ~0..7), _amp (operator level / EG)
inc = _freq/srate;
avg = 0.5*(y1 + y2);                        // 2-sample average = the DX7 detail
//avg = y1;
phase += inc;
phase -= (phase>=1.0);
out0 = _amp * sin(2.0*$pi*phase + _fb*avg);
y2 = y1;
y1 = out0;
